SunTag and A549<sup>\u0394STAT1</sup>-SunTag cells transduced with <i>MX1</i> gRNA or NTG gRNA (NTG). Error bars indicate \u00b1 SD. <b>(D)</b> Representative flow cytometry histograms for GFP fluorescence in A549-SunTag and A549<sup>\u0394STAT1</sup>-SunTag transduced with <i>MX1</i> gRNA (blue) or NTG (gray) gRNA and infected with VSV-GFP (M.O.I. = 1, 24hr). <b>(E)</b> Percent VSV-GFP-positive cells by flow cytometry quantified for n = 3 biological replicates. Bars represent mean \u00b1 SD of GFP positive cells across all replicates. Paired ratio Student\u2019s t-test, *** p < 0.0005.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1160144, "created_date": "2022-04-14T17:54:05Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-14T07:24:21Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["pooled genetic screens", "isogenic cell lines", "cdna expression experiments", "proapoptotic isg activities", "inducible isg expression", "isg antiviral functions", "isg repertoire", "antiviral state", "viral specificities", "throughput interrogation", "throughput approach", "studies demonstrate", "stimulated genes"], "keywords": ["pooled genetic screens", "isogenic cell lines", "cdna expression experiments", "proapoptotic isg activities", "inducible isg expression", "isg antiviral functions", "isg repertoire", "antiviral state", "viral specificities", "throughput interrogation", "throughput approach", "studies demonstrate", "stimulated genes"], "categories": [{"id": 13, "title": "Genetics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 24, "title": "Evolutionary Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 272, 